      !>## Version
      !>
      !>-    SPICELIB Version 1.1.0, 13-JAN-2021 (NJB) (JDR) (BVS)
      !>
      !>        Bug fix: in some cases the previous version of this routine
      !>        could still return an intercept outside of the segment
